      "title": "Shapes, Lines, Grids, Patterns, Containers, Dividers  \u00b7  off-white page",
      "change_note": "Rewritten to match the drawings: the shape row includes a circle; \u201cPatterns\u201d described translucent blocks, but the page shows a zigzag pattern and the dividers use a fluted gradient; the Containers rule (clipped corners) is contradicted by every rounded box in the PDF \u2014 see Decision 1. Grids, Containers, and Dividers have no illustration; add three small examples.",
